# QEMU 11.1.1's EDID generator: qemu-edid calls qemu_edid_generate (hw/display/edid-generate.c),
# the function virtio-gpu answers VIRTIO_GPU_CMD_GET_EDID with (hw/display/virtio-gpu-base.c).
$ qemu-system-x86_64 --version
QEMU emulator version 11.1.1
Copyright (c) 2003-2026 Fabrice Bellard and the QEMU Project developers
EXIT=0
$ qemu-system-x86_64 -display help
Available display backend types:
none
curses
cocoa
dbus

Some display backends support suboptions, which can be set with
   -display backend,option=value,option=value...
For a short list of the suboptions for each display, see the top-level -help output; more detail is in the documentation.
EXIT=0

